  {
   "id": 646691,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"3\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>Describe the transformations made from the parent linear function to achieve <span data-math=\"g(x)=\\frac12 x -4\">g(x)=\\frac12 x -4</span>. <strong>Select two</strong> that apply:</li>\n</ol>\n<ol type=\"a\">\n  <li>Vertical stretch of <span data-math=\"\\frac12\">\\frac12</span></li>\n  <li>Vertical compression of <span data-math=\"\\frac12\">\\frac12</span></li>\n  <li>Up 4</li>\n  <li>Down 4</li>\n  <li>Right 4</li>\n  <li>Left 4</li>\n</ol>",
